So we still use ls -l and awk
the only thing is that remember when we run something like ls -l, it will show something like:
total xx$
-rwxxxxxxxxxxx 1 eagle eagle xx xx 15 10:10 skip.sh$
....

it means total xx$ is always the first line, and then the files we created

